Planning Commission Recommendation:
The Planning Commission heard this item at their August 21, 2023, meeting and voted 4-0 to
recommend the Governing Body approve Option B as listed in the staff report with the addition of
“Manufactured homes shall be built to the current HUD code as referenced in the federal manufactured
housing construction and safety standards.”
The Planning Commission Staff report is attached and has not been changed. The ordinance provided is
